    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just hard talking to a professional about it. they just give you the same canned responses. it doesn't change the fact that the person i was is dead. i don't have anything to offer anyone anymore. i'm just an empty shell. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to end.",
